<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', {
        partnersBrand: true,
        preloadImage: '/img/partners-cover.webp'
    }) %>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Preciso ter CNPJ para ser parceiro ou posso cadastrar como Pessoa Física?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Você pode participar como pessoa física ou jurídica. CPF da pessoa física e chave Pix podem ser completados após o cadastro, antes do primeiro pagamento. Para PJ, o CNPJ é exigido no cadastro."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Como e quando a comissão de 3% é paga?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A comissão prevista nos termos do programa é calculada em 3% sobre o valor líquido dos itens contratados elegíveis e atribuídos à sua indicação, paga via Pix após quitação e conciliação integral."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "E se outro parceiro já tiver indicado o mesmo cliente?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "O sistema utiliza a regra de Primeiro Registro Válido (First Claim) com análise de vínculos e do atendimento existente para definir a atribuição."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Em quais cidades e estados a Klyfe atende pelo programa?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "O Klyfe Partners atende em todas as cidades da Paraíba (PB), Pernambuco (PE) e Rio Grande do Norte (RN)."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Preciso fazer a venda técnica ou fechar o contrato com o cliente?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Não. Seu papel é apenas apresentar a oportunidade. Toda a visita técnica, levantamento de carga, elaboração de projeto executivo, negociação comercial e emissão de ART é realizada pela equipe de engenharia da Klyfe."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
    </script>
    <style>
        /* ==========================================================================
           KLYFE PARTNERS - LIGHT THEME SYSTEM
           ========================================================================== */
        :root {
            --kp-gold: #D97706;
            --kp-gold-vibrant: #F59E0B;
            --kp-gold-glow: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.20);
            --kp-gold-light: #FFFBEB;
            --kp-gold-border: #FDE68A;
            --kp-mint: #059669;
            --kp-mint-light: #ECFDF5;
            --kp-mint-border: #A7F3D0;
            --kp-slate-dark: #0F172A;
            --kp-slate-heading: #1E293B;
            --kp-slate-muted: #526071;
            --kp-border: #E2E8F0;
            --kp-bg-card: #FFFFFF;
            --kp-bg-soft: #F8FAFC;
            --kp-bg-subtle: #F1F5F9;
        }

        .page-partners {
            background-color: var(--kp-bg-soft);
            color: var(--kp-slate-dark);
            --bg-primary: #F8FAFC;
            --bg-secondary: #FFFFFF;
            --text-main: #0F172A;
            --text-muted: #526071;
            --border-color: #E2E8F0;
            --nav-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Navbar Light Foundation */
        .page-partners .navbar {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        }
        .page-partners .navbar.navbar-pill {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
        }
        .page-partners .navbar .nav-links a {
            color: #0F172A;
        }
        .page-partners .navbar .nav-links a:hover,
        .page-partners .navbar .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--kp-gold);
        }
        .page-partners .navbar .logo-cls-white {
            fill: #0F172A;
        }

        /* 1. Hero Section */
        .partners-hero {
            padding: 7.5rem 0 4.5rem;
            position: relative;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 12% 20%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.07) 0%, transparent 40%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 70%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.05) 0%, transparent 45%),
                        #FFFFFF;
        }
        .partners-hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
            gap: 3.5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .partners-hero-text h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 1.2rem 0;
            color: var(--kp-slate-dark);
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .partners-hero-text h1 .text-highlight {
            color: var(--kp-gold);
        }
        .partners-hero-lead {
            font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.22rem);
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            max-width: 620px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .partners-badge-group {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
            background: var(--kp-gold-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-gold-border);
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: #92400E;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .partners-hero-ctas {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
        }
        .partners-hero-ctas .btn {
            padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }
        .btn-gold {
            background: var(--kp-gold-vibrant);
            color: #0F172A;
            border: 1px solid #F59E0B;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.28);
        }
        .btn-gold:hover {
            background: #EAB308;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.38);
            color: #0F172A;
        }
        .btn-light-outline {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            color: #0F172A;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--kp-border);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
        }
        .btn-light-outline:hover {
            border-color: #0F172A;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            background: #F8FAFC;
        }
        .btn-light-ghost {
            background: transparent;
            color: #475569;
            border: none;
        }
        .btn-light-ghost:hover {
            color: var(--kp-gold);
        }
        .partners-quick-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.25rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
        }
        .quick-tag-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
        }
        .quick-tag-item i {
            color: var(--kp-gold);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Hero Visual Showcase */
        .partners-hero-visual {
            position: relative;
        }
        .visual-frame {
            position: relative;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .visual-frame img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }
        .visual-frame:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.015);
        }
        .floating-pill {
            position: absolute;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--kp-slate-dark);
            z-index: 2;
            animation: floatSlow 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }
        .floating-pill.pill-top {
            top: 20px;
            right: -15px;
            border-color: var(--kp-mint-border);
        }
        .floating-pill.pill-bottom {
            bottom: 25px;
            left: -15px;
            border-color: var(--kp-gold-border);
            animation-delay: -2s;
        }
        .floating-pill .pill-dot {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .pill-top .pill-dot { background: var(--kp-mint); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.4); }
        .pill-bottom .pill-dot { background: var(--kp-gold); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.4); }

        @keyframes floatSlow {
            from { transform: translateY(0px); }
            to { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }

        /* Metric Strip */
        .partners-metric-strip {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        .metric-strip-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .metric-strip-item strong {
            display: block;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 2.3rem;
            color: var(--kp-gold);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }
        .metric-strip-item span {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Sections General */
        .kp-section {
            padding: 5.5rem 0;
            position: relative;
        }
        .kp-section-light {
            background: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .kp-section-soft {
            background: var(--kp-bg-soft);
        }
        .kp-section-header {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 780px;
            margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
        }
        .kp-section-header .badge-mono {
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--kp-gold-light);
            color: #92400E;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-gold-border);
        }
        .kp-section-header h2 {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.9rem);
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--kp-slate-dark);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .kp-section-header p {
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* 2. Personas */
        .personas-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
        .persona-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 2rem 1.8rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }
        .persona-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 3px;
            background: var(--kp-gold);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }
        .persona-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: #FCD34D;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
        }
        .persona-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }
        .persona-icon {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--kp-gold-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-gold-border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--kp-gold);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        }
        .persona-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            color: #0F172A;
        }
        .persona-card p {
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 0.93rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }
        .persona-gain {
            background: var(--kp-mint-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-mint-border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: #047857;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        /* 3. 4 Families / 36 Services */
        .catalog-tabs {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .catalog-tab-btn {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--kp-border);
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }
        .catalog-tab-btn i {
            color: var(--kp-gold);
        }
        .catalog-tab-btn.active, .catalog-tab-btn:hover {
            color: #0F172A;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-color: var(--kp-gold);
        }
        .catalog-tab-btn.active {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.15);
        }
        .catalog-panel {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeInTab 0.3s ease forwards;
        }
        .catalog-panel.active {
            display: block;
        }
        @keyframes fadeInTab {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .catalog-items-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1.25rem;
        }
        .service-pill-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.3rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }
        .service-pill-card:hover {
            border-color: #FCD34D;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        .service-pill-card h4 {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            color: #0F172A;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }
        .service-pill-card p {
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            line-height: 1.45;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }
        .service-pill-card .service-cat-tag {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--kp-gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Concessionárias Banner */
        .utility-banner {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }
        .utility-banner-text strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #0F172A;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }
        .utility-banner-text span {
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .utility-logos {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .utility-badge {
            background: var(--kp-bg-soft);
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: #1E293B;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .utility-badge i {
            color: var(--kp-gold);
        }

        /* 4. Tech Ecosystem / Portal Features */
        .tech-features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
        .tech-feature-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .tech-feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: #FCD34D;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }
        .tech-feature-card strong {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--kp-gold);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .tech-feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            color: #0F172A;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }
        .tech-feature-card p {
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 0.93rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* 5. Steps */
        .steps-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }
        .step-box {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }
        .step-num {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.22);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: block;
        }
        .step-box h3 {
            font-size: 1.28rem;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            color: #0F172A;
            margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
        }
        .step-box p {
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        /* 6. Security Box */
        .security-container-box {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }

        /* 7. FAQ Accordion (Isolado e com Animação Suave) */
        .kp-faq-accordion {
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .kp-faq-item {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--kp-border);
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
        }
        .kp-faq-item.active {
            border-color: var(--kp-gold-vibrant);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.09);
        }
        .kp-faq-question {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.35rem 1.6rem;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #0F172A;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .kp-faq-question * {
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .kp-faq-question i {
            color: var(--kp-gold);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        .kp-faq-item.active .kp-faq-question i {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }
        .kp-faq-answer {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), padding 0.3s ease;
            padding: 0 1.6rem;
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }
        .kp-faq-item.active .kp-faq-answer {
            max-height: 600px;
            padding: 0 1.6rem 1.4rem;
        }
        .kp-faq-answer p {
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* 8. Final CTA */
        .partners-cta-section {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F8FAFC 0%, #FEFCE8 100%);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--kp-gold-border);
            padding: 6rem 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .cta-content-box {
            max-width: 780px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .cta-content-box h2 {
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #0F172A;
        }
        .cta-content-box p {
            color: var(--kp-slate-muted);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.4rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
